  "instructions": [
    "Preheat oven to 400 degrees Fahrenheit.",
    "Roll out puff pastry on a floured surface to a large rectangle.",
    "Butter the pastry, leaving a 1 inch border around the edges.",
    "Arrange prosciutto slices on one half of the pastry, leaving a small border around the edges.",
    "Top the prosciutto with padron peppers, garlic, parmesan cheese, salt, and pepper.",
    "Fold the other half of the pastry over the filling, pressing the edges to seal.",
    "Brush the pastry with olive oil and cut into 6 equal pieces.",
    "Place the saltimbocca on a baking sheet lined with parchment paper and bake for 20 minutes.",
    "Remove from oven and sprinkle with parsley.",
    "Serve hot and enjoy."
  ],
